    "detailed_description": "Join the early testing phase of our innovative open world voxel game and play a crucial role in cocreating a universe teeming with potential. Craft a character that reflects your style, race around the city in high-octane vehicles, manage your underground empire or team up with friends for daring operations and thrilling heists!<br><br><br><strong>- Personalize Your Unique Character: Exhibit Your Extraordinary style!</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730860/extras/ebb6a82e3be9d593caf418597ffa3b52.poster.avif?t=1728028367\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730860/extras/ebb6a82e3be9d593caf418597ffa3b52.webm?t=1728028367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730860/extras/ebb6a82e3be9d593caf418597ffa3b52.mp4?t=1728028367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Freely mold your identity with our indepth character customization options. Whether it's a classic jacket, a signature hairstyle, or dazzling bling; choose the details that make you stand out from the crowd. Be the most genuine you!<br><br><br><strong>- Explore a vast Open World: Cruise in custom vehicles, roam around Golden Bay</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730860/extras/5887a0331a72f8572da18369e4b254ee.poster.avif?t=1728028367\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730860/extras/5887a0331a72f8572da18369e4b254ee.webm?t=1728028367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730860/extras/5887a0331a72f8572da18369e4b254ee.mp4?t=1728028367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Explore endless possibilities in a gigantic, living and breathing open world. From its towering skyscrapers to charming suburbs, view the city of Golden Bay in an everchanging light with dynamic day/night and weather cycles. <br><br><br><strong>- Manage Your Underground Empire: Run the city from the shadows!</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730860/extras/cec045134c8ef97deef222433456c900.poster.avif?t=1728028367\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730860/extras/cec045134c8ef97deef222433456c900.webm?t=1728028367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730860/extras/cec045134c8ef97deef222433456c900.mp4?t=1728028367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Find your place in the underworld, or resist it! Band together with friends to build your criminal enterprise from the ground up, tackling threats from rival gangs and security forces. Even if the police prove only a minor hindrance, there's always someone else plotting to take your crown.<br><br><br><strong>- New Battle Experience: Bring the heat to the streets!</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730860/extras/099d71aa8dfa9a7f2e07cd09ad527c91.poster.avif?t=1728028367\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730860/extras/099d71aa8dfa9a7f2e07cd09ad527c91.webm?t=1728028367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730860/extras/099d71aa8dfa9a7f2e07cd09ad527c91.mp4?t=1728028367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Fight alongside your friends or gun them down to prove who rules the streets. Every move in this volatile neighbourhood matters - a single false step is all it takes to seal your fate. Feel the intensity with realistic firearms and ordinance!<br><br><br><strong>- Director Mode: The World Is Yours!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730860/extras/b483a7e2d1aec2de44d44f722a4c284c.poster.avif?t=1728028367\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730860/extras/b483a7e2d1aec2de44d44f722a4c284c.webm?t=1728028367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730860/extras/b483a7e2d1aec2de44d44f722a4c284c.mp4?t=1728028367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Direct your own movie scenes in FREE LIFE\u2018s one-of-a-kind Director Mode! Craft sets, freely place game props, direct NPCs to perform actions according to your vision. Bring to life the stories that only you can tell!<br><br>This is all just the tip of the iceberg for what FREE LIFE can become. Development is ongoing as we prepare to meet the expectations of our community. We look forward to meeting you and turning this blank canvas of a game into a vibrant masterpiece - together. Thank you for your interest and support! Join us in FREE LIFE and leave your mark in our shared virtual world.",
    "about_the_game": "Join the early testing phase of our innovative open world voxel game and play a crucial role in cocreating a universe teeming with potential. Craft a character that reflects your style, race around the city in high-octane vehicles, manage your underground empire or team up with friends for daring operations and thrilling heists!<br><br><br><strong>- Personalize Your Unique Character: Exhibit Your Extraordinary style!</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730860/extras/ebb6a82e3be9d593caf418597ffa3b52.poster.avif?t=1728028367\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730860/extras/ebb6a82e3be9d593caf418597ffa3b52.webm?t=1728028367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730860/extras/ebb6a82e3be9d593caf418597ffa3b52.mp4?t=1728028367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Freely mold your identity with our indepth character customization options. Whether it's a classic jacket, a signature hairstyle, or dazzling bling; choose the details that make you stand out from the crowd. Be the most genuine you!<br><br><br><strong>- Explore a vast Open World: Cruise in custom vehicles, roam around Golden Bay</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730860/extras/5887a0331a72f8572da18369e4b254ee.poster.avif?t=1728028367\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730860/extras/5887a0331a72f8572da18369e4b254ee.webm?t=1728028367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730860/extras/5887a0331a72f8572da18369e4b254ee.mp4?t=1728028367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Explore endless possibilities in a gigantic, living and breathing open world. From its towering skyscrapers to charming suburbs, view the city of Golden Bay in an everchanging light with dynamic day/night and weather cycles. <br><br><br><strong>- Manage Your Underground Empire: Run the city from the shadows!</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730860/extras/cec045134c8ef97deef222433456c900.poster.avif?t=1728028367\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730860/extras/cec045134c8ef97deef222433456c900.webm?t=1728028367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730860/extras/cec045134c8ef97deef222433456c900.mp4?t=1728028367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Find your place in the underworld, or resist it! Band together with friends to build your criminal enterprise from the ground up, tackling threats from rival gangs and security forces. Even if the police prove only a minor hindrance, there's always someone else plotting to take your crown.<br><br><br><strong>- New Battle Experience: Bring the heat to the streets!</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730860/extras/099d71aa8dfa9a7f2e07cd09ad527c91.poster.avif?t=1728028367\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730860/extras/099d71aa8dfa9a7f2e07cd09ad527c91.webm?t=1728028367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730860/extras/099d71aa8dfa9a7f2e07cd09ad527c91.mp4?t=1728028367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Fight alongside your friends or gun them down to prove who rules the streets. Every move in this volatile neighbourhood matters - a single false step is all it takes to seal your fate. Feel the intensity with realistic firearms and ordinance!<br><br><br><strong>- Director Mode: The World Is Yours!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730860/extras/b483a7e2d1aec2de44d44f722a4c284c.poster.avif?t=1728028367\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730860/extras/b483a7e2d1aec2de44d44f722a4c284c.webm?t=1728028367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730860/extras/b483a7e2d1aec2de44d44f722a4c284c.mp4?t=1728028367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Direct your own movie scenes in FREE LIFE\u2018s one-of-a-kind Director Mode! Craft sets, freely place game props, direct NPCs to perform actions according to your vision. Bring to life the stories that only you can tell!<br><br>This is all just the tip of the iceberg for what FREE LIFE can become. Development is ongoing as we prepare to meet the expectations of our community. We look forward to meeting you and turning this blank canvas of a game into a vibrant masterpiece - together. Thank you for your interest and support! Join us in FREE LIFE and leave your mark in our shared virtual world.",
